===== Specific configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description  ^ Default configuration ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi   | 192.168.1.1/24        |
| eth0             | LAN port     | None                  |
| eth1             | WAN port     | DHCP                  |
| wlan0            | WiFi 2.4 GHz | Disabled              |
| wlan1            | WiFi 5 GHz   | Disabled              |

==== Buttons ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:hardware:hardware.button]] on howto use and configure the hardware button(s).
Here, we merely name the buttons, so we can use them in the above Howto.

The cAP ac has the following buttons:

^ BUTTON ^ Event ^
| Reset  | -     |
| Mode   | -     |

==== LEDs ====
-> How to configure LEDs in general, see the LED section in the [[docs:guide-user:base-system:led_configuration]].

The cAP ac has 7 LEDs:

^ LED name  ^ LED print ^ Internal name      |
| Power     | POWER     | capac:blue:power   |
| PoE out   | POE out   | capac:green:poeout |
| Eth1      | ETH1      | capac:green:eth1   |
| Eth2      | ETH2      | capac:green:eth2   |
| Wlan 2GHz | 2G        | capac:green:wlan2  |
| Wlan 5GHz | 5G        | capac:green:wlan5  |
| User      | USER      | capac:green:user   |

Led ''user'' and button ''mode'' are replicated in the center of device.

==== GPIOs ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.gpio]]

The cAP ac uses the following GPIO pins: 

^ GPIO ^ Common Name       ^ Internal Name      ^ 
^ ?    | Power LED         | capac:blue:power   |
^ ?    | User LED          | capac:green:user   | 
^ ?    | POE out LED       | capac:green:poeout |
^ ?    | Eth1 LED          | capac:green:eth1   |
^ ?    | Eth2 LED          | capac:green:eth2   |
^ ?    | Wlan 2GHz LED     | capac:green:wlan2  |
^ ?    | Wlan 5GHz LED     | capac:green:wlan5  |
^ ?    | Reset button      |                    |
^ ?    | Mode  button      |                    |
^ 54   | Boot flash (SPI0) |                    |
^ 55   | Boot flash (SPI0) |                    |
^ 56   | Boot flash (SPI0) |                    |
^ 57   | Boot flash (SPI0) |                    |
^ 60   | UART 0            | serial0            | 
^ 60   | UART 0            | serial0            | 
^ ?    | POE out           | capac:poe:out      |

===== Hardware =====
==== Info ====
^ Architecture     | ARM 32bit                       |
^ Vendor           | Qualcomm                        |
^ Bootloader       | RouterBOOT                      |
^ System-On-Chip   | IPQ4018                         |
